<p>Your actions foreshadow a bleak outcome for your foes.</p><p>Each time you deal darkness, fire, blight or acid damage you curse your foe with an effect that stacks up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> times (this can happen only once per creature per turn).</p><p>The vim you get for killing the creature is increased by 100% for every stack of Bleak Outcome.</p><p>The vim's worth of a creature depends on your Willpower.</p>